 "realtime_factor": 0.0170860068814923,
 "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days? They usually are, if you pick one with a good reputation and few extras. Spending a few hundred is normal. Then a planner can help you both sign up for things together, and make sure everyone gets invited who matters. Would you rather spend ten minutes with each other every month? It means just one day, but all the planning leading up to it, from both you and the wedding planner. The day itself is usually quite short. It is, if you enjoy each other's company. Then find way to show her that it's not her wedding after all. Maybe you take turns leading the ceremony, and she just reads the important bits. I' glad. Now go ask her to coffee, and tell her about this plan. See how she reacts.",
